content.text:
Now CSS redesign. Need remove or override old sidebar styles and add new. Since old styles minified earlier, append overrides at end with sufficient specificity. Remove X CSS unused, but can leave. Better add new design block. Must handle base + dark + mobile.

Base overrides:
```
/* Sidebar redesign */
.sidebar{background:linear-gradient(165deg,rgba(255,255,255,.94),rgba(244,247,255,.86) 60%,rgba(239,244,255,.92));border-right:1px solid rgba(219,226,240,.9);box-shadow:12px 0 40px rgba(58,72,120,.04)}
.sidebar::before{content:'';position:absolute;pointer-events:none;width:180px;height:180px;right:-80px;top:-70px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(208,219,255,.75),rgba(208,219,255,0) 70%);}
.sidebar-top{position:relative;z-index:1;display:block;margin:0 0 32px 4px}
.sidebar-tagline{...}
.brand{margin:0}
.brand-icon{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e6ebff,#f4e8ff);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 #fff, 0 4px 12px rgba(93,110,190,.12);color:#5e73d8}
.workspace-label{color:#9aa5bb;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1.8px;padding-left:10px;margin-bottom:9px}
.main-nav{position:relative;z-index:1;gap:5px}
.nav-link{padding:11px 12px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12.5px;color:#7b8599}
.nav-link:hover{background:#eef1fb;color:#5266b3;transform:translateX(2px)}
.nav-link.active{background:linear-gradient(100deg,#e9edff,#f1ecff);color:#5266cf;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(196,205,247,.7);font-weight:700;position:relative}
.nav-link.active::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:10px;bottom:10px;width:3px;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;background:#7487e6}
.nav-icon{width:20px;height:20px;color:#8994ab}
.nav-link.active .nav-icon{color:#6a7ee0}
.sidebar-divider{margin:20px 8px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#e5eaf4 15%,#e5eaf4 85%,transparent)}
